        "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued November 8 at 1:48AM EST until November 9 at 6:00PM EST by NWS Upton NY",
        "description": "* WHAT...West winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt.\n\n* WHERE...Long Island Sound, New York Harbor, Peconic and Gardiners Bays, and South Shore Bays from Jones Inlet through Shinnecock Bay.\n\n* WHEN...Until 6 PM EST Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
        "instruction": "Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.",
